        <div><a name="_jewish" id="_jewish"></a><p class="h2Annex">C.24 Jewish</p><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_27cc02eb-32d5-495c-a8bd-f2853f52c760" id="_27cc02eb-32d5-495c-a8bd-f2853f52c760"></a>name components:</p>

  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo30;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">
    family name
  </p>
  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo30;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">
    given name
  </p>
  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo30;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">
    patronymic name
  </p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_7ff3248f-9981-42f3-ad3f-d040b403dde5" id="_7ff3248f-9981-42f3-ad3f-d040b403dde5"></a>Modern Jewish names include Hebrew patronymic names as well as family names.</p>
<div><a name="_typical_name_patterns_8" id="_typical_name_patterns_8"></a><p class="h3Annex">C.24.1 Typical name patterns</p><p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table C.37</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_7a6a990e-8184-49fc-8975-2ae36294cea4" id="_7a6a990e-8184-49fc-8975-2ae36294cea4"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">patronymic name</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table C.38</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_b8382d37-6ee7-4286-b7de-227126d8f4d8" id="_b8382d37-6ee7-4286-b7de-227126d8f4d8"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">family name</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<div><a name="_examples_8" id="_examples_8"></a><p class="h3Annex">C.24.2 Examples</p>

