        <div><a name="_portuguese" id="_portuguese"></a><p class="h2Annex">C.35 Portuguese</p><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_46a5cc24-a08a-486b-aca3-184d1eb1e776" id="_46a5cc24-a08a-486b-aca3-184d1eb1e776"></a>name components:</p>

  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo34;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">
    given name
  </p>
  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo34;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">
    matronymic name
  </p>
  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo34;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">
    patronymic name
  </p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_65595b7a-ca3a-403e-957c-a54e7d906412" id="_65595b7a-ca3a-403e-957c-a54e7d906412"></a>Portuguese often have two personal names, although the first may at times be used on its own.</p>
<div><a name="_typical_name_patterns_12" id="_typical_name_patterns_12"></a><p class="h3Annex">C.35.1 Typical name patterns</p>

  <p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table C.46</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_636a7121-12d8-4c2b-95a8-74bba60f1e60" id="_636a7121-12d8-4c2b-95a8-74bba60f1e60"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">mother&#x2019;s patronymic name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">father&#x2019;s patronymic name</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
</div>
<div><a name="_examples_12" id="_examples_12"></a><p class="h3Annex">C.35.2 Examples</p><div class="example"><a name="_e3c2d2da-a5af-4281-ba76-a24638364824" id="_e3c2d2da-a5af-4281-ba76-a24638364824"></a><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE  1</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>George Agostinho Baptista da Silva</p></div>
<div class="example"><a name="_5f96ca61-9d05-400d-8e53-95fab0ba43d1" id="_5f96ca61-9d05-400d-8e53-95fab0ba43d1"></a><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE  2</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>&#x201C;Ant&#xF3;nio Caetano de Abreu Freire Egas Moniz&#x201D;, Nobel prize winner. He was the
child of &#x201C;Fernando de Pina Rezende Abreu&#x201D; and &#x201C;Maria do Rosario de Almeida e Sousa&#x201D;.</p></div></div></div>
