        <div><a name="_thai" id="_thai"></a><p class="h2Annex">C.45 Thai</p><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_71cdb756-ddad-4735-85f6-83f4238fff84" id="_71cdb756-ddad-4735-85f6-83f4238fff84"></a>name components:</p>

  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo37;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">
    family name
  </p>
  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo37;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">
    given name
  </p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_60f830a8-ae28-4d5f-b0a1-1c870b8e2f58" id="_60f830a8-ae28-4d5f-b0a1-1c870b8e2f58"></a>Modern Thai names are composed of given names followed by the family name.
Prior to 1913, family names were not required.</p>
<div><a name="_typical_name_patterns_15" id="_typical_name_patterns_15"></a><p class="h3Annex">C.45.1 Typical name patterns</p><p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table C.49</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_e6c53f64-6590-45ee-a630-0edc5daf1646" id="_e6c53f64-6590-45ee-a630-0edc5daf1646"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table C.50</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_2100bb84-e16f-4f33-b55f-ef33803f398b" id="_2100bb84-e16f-4f33-b55f-ef33803f398b"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">family name</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<div><a name="_examples_15" id="_examples_15"></a><p class="h3Annex">C.45.2 Examples</p>

  <div class="example"><a name="_73584a58-cd78-43b8-9bc3-cf6dd22254e1" id="_73584a58-cd78-43b8-9bc3-cf6dd22254e1"></a><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>&#xE0A;&#xE27;&#xE19; &#xE2B;&#xE25;&#xE35;&#xE01;&#xE20;&#xE31;&#xE22; (&#x201C;Chuan Likphai&#x201D;)</p></div>
