        <div><a name="_vietnamese" id="_vietnamese"></a><p class="h2Annex">C.48 Vietnamese</p><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_5ed5532b-0ba7-4342-9e4f-432f54081348" id="_5ed5532b-0ba7-4342-9e4f-432f54081348"></a>name components:</p>

  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo38;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">
    given name
  </p>
  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo38;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">
    additional name
  </p>
  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo38;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">
    family name
  </p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_7cb1302a-f636-4c44-b5f7-3633dc725b5c" id="_7cb1302a-f636-4c44-b5f7-3633dc725b5c"></a>Vietnamese personal names are names used by those from Vietnam and the
Vietnamese diaspora overseas.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_568b6d26-9f0b-46d8-a2d3-a6128149a1a7" id="_568b6d26-9f0b-46d8-a2d3-a6128149a1a7"></a>Vietnamese names consist of a family name (T&#xEA;n, &#x20E1B;),
followed by a given name (H&#x1ECD;, /&#x22A5C;).
Between the family name and given name,
one or more additional names may be present.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_4aecaa66-c1ed-477c-b2e3-eaaa6d023fab" id="_4aecaa66-c1ed-477c-b2e3-eaaa6d023fab"></a>Vietnamese additional names can be a
middle name (t&#xEA;n &#x111;&#x1EC7;m),
generational name,
or clan distinguisher name. The middle name, for identification purposes, can be omitted.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_2e7177d4-186d-46ec-a652-9412009affc7" id="_2e7177d4-186d-46ec-a652-9412009affc7"></a>Courtesy names are also allowed, separate from the given name.</p>
<div><a name="_typical_name_patterns_16" id="_typical_name_patterns_16"></a><p class="h3Annex">C.48.1 Typical name patterns</p><p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table C.51</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_03b57360-4e87-4e1f-a359-66780218c539" id="_03b57360-4e87-4e1f-a359-66780218c539"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
